API error names:
  application_error               The platform failed to handle the request.
  body_content_rejected           The message body was rejected by the content scan.
  browser_not_allowed             The request came from a browser, which cannot hold an API key safely.
  concurrent_idempotent_requests  Another request with the same idempotency key is still in flight.
  from_domain_not_allowed         The from address is not on a domain this API key can send from.
  invalid_api_key                 The API key was not accepted.
  invalid_attachment              An attachment could not be read.
  invalid_from_address            The from address is not a valid address.
  invalid_idempotency_key         The idempotency key is not in an acceptable form.
  invalid_idempotent_request      This idempotency key was already used for a different message.
  invalid_request_body            The request body was not readable as JSON.
  link_reputation_blocked         A link in the message is on a host with poor reputation.
  max_message_size_exceeded       The message is larger than your plan allows.
  max_recipients_exceeded         The message names more recipients than your plan allows.
  method_not_allowed              The endpoint does not accept that HTTP method.
  missing_required_field          A required field was absent.
  missing_required_variable       The template needs a variable the request did not supply.
  missing_user_agent              The request carried no User-Agent.
  not_acceptable                  The request asked for a representation the endpoint cannot produce.
  quota_exceeded                  Your organisation's message quota for the current period is exhausted.
  rate_limit_exceeded             Requests are arriving faster than your plan allows.
  scheduled_email_not_found       No scheduled email has that id.
  scheduled_email_not_pending     That scheduled email is no longer pending, so it cannot be changed.
  scheduling_not_included         Scheduled sending is not included in your plan.
  template_not_found              No template has that id.
  template_not_published          The template exists but has no published version to render.
  topic_disabled                  That topic exists but is switched off.
  topic_not_found                 No topic with that slug exists on the sending domain.
  unsupported_media_type          The request's content type is not one the endpoint accepts.
  validation_error                The request was well-formed but a field failed validation.

SMTP reply codes:
  421        The service is not available and the connection is closing.
  450        The mailbox was unavailable, temporarily.
  452        The server has insufficient storage to accept the message now.
  454 4.7.0  Authentication was refused temporarily, usually because it is being throttled.
  535 5.7.8  The username or password was rejected.
  550        The mailbox was unavailable, permanently.
  552        The message exceeded a size limit.
  554        The transaction failed, and the server will not accept this message.

  Explain one with `mailkube errors explain <name>`.
